                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                        "entry_id": "b59a881e-5854-3894-8777-0f04f101d940",
                        "glosses": [
                            "интеллектуальная игра; разделённое на множество фигурных частей изображение, которое необходимо собрать воедино"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "86d1c11e-ebb2-4020-9a75-40fd0d0d5d31",
                                "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                                "text": "Дети с интересом собирали фигурные пазлы в надежде увидеть фотографию собаки."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "314aa2fc-ea28-424b-91cc-0a41d5ae61c3",
                                "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                                "text": "― Мы пазл с мужем собираем. Ну, картинки такие, из кусочков."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3b4712da-ba4c-49dc-a0a3-663f69685da2",
                                "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                                "text": "Именно такую мозаику и представляет собой всякий раз номер журнала, а читателю всякий раз будто предлагается своеобразный пазл, игра ― в «меру собственного разумения» сложить различные фрагменты в одну картинку."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "e5df0c9b-9d41-4529-82e0-2db319437794",
                                "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                                "text": "Есть здесь и настольные игры, как «индивидуальные» так и «коллективные» ― конструкторы (в том числе и типа «Лего»), пазлы, «Монополия», «Алые паруса», «Я ― доктор», бильярд, домино, активные игры: дартс (с копьями и на липучках) и наборы для ролевых игр («Полиция», «Ниндзя», «Медицинский»)."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c4240342-0e99-4f21-9e5e-22442d5b0cc0",
                                "sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                                "text": "У большинства слово «пазл» ассоциируется с детской разрезалкой-мозаикой."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "4d3c8fb7-510f-4cb4-8dd8-69c0f960a388",
                        "source_entry_id": "b59a881e-5854-3894-8777-0f04f101d940",
                        "source_sense_id": "d890069f-0aad-3093-9098-ce8635297e8a",
                        "target_lang_word": "puzzle",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "puzzle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "eeac0a6f-265d-3149-98b3-549d03413732",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Anything that is difficult to understand or make sense of."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e27f7a9-7bca-41b5-a182-352d2d561582",
                                                "sense_id": "eeac0a6f-265d-3149-98b3-549d03413732",
                                                "text": "Where he went after he left the house is a puzzle."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "def1acb4-1bd8-399d-a684-bd0261711b2f",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A game for one or more people that is more or less difficult to work out or complete."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "af876aa7-0c4d-343e-8fa8-211c0a1145a3",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A crossword puzzle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08bf53af-6b70-31d3-a601-677e867b6d3a",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A jigsaw puzzle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "da935cbe-e902-3b2a-b9c6-06892a8289fd",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A riddle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6727a84a-e207-39e7-ac06-8de29c1efb86",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something made with marvellous skill; something of ingenious construction."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "archaic"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f2b4498b-b140-3b25-9999-0cc2ff8489ca",
                                        "entry_id": "828d26c6-64c2-31a5-b885-84ad1f0ab442",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being puzzled; perplexity."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4e43e7cd-05be-4038-ba9b-cf72e4ede683",
                                                "sense_id": "f2b4498b-b140-3b25-9999-0cc2ff8489ca",
                                                "text": "to be in a puzzle"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "puzzle",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b2ec1b-9edc-3238-91a7-13b130556ef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To perplex, confuse, or mystify; to cause (someone) to be faced with a mystery, without answers or an explanation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6b233774-5ca0-4bb8-a1c9-f77471a0e3fa",
                                                "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                                "text": "Mens daily occaſions for themſelves or friends, and the neceſities of common life, require the doing of a thouſand things vvithin the compaſs of a fevv dayes, for vvhich it vvould puzzle the beſt Textman that liveth; readily to bethink himself of a ſentence in the Bible, clear enough to ſatisfie a ſcrupulous conſcience of the lavvfulneſs and expediency of vvhat he is about to do; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "380f0657-a24f-4d04-aa4f-aadf3b1efa20",
                                                "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                                "text": "[H]e has a very ſmart VVit, and is a very ſhrevvd Diſputant in thoſe Points himſelf ſeems moſt puzzled in, and is therein very dexterous in puzzling others, if they be not thorough-paced Speculators in thoſe great Theories."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9f7bb7bc-cd61-48eb-9591-c8cf7a3d7942",
                                                "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                                "text": "He is perpetually puzzled and perplexed amidst his own blunders."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8c931f4-44f2-48f4-922d-06d6f814c6fd",
                                                "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                                "text": "The case was that of a murder. It had an element of mystery about it, however, which was puzzling the authorities. A turban and loincloth soaked in blood had been found; also a staff."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6c9c7857-89a9-4610-bf35-4124d68a4929",
                                                "sense_id": "8d842fad-9c21-3941-825f-86cecef2dcd8",
                                                "text": "When it comes to God’s existence, I’m not an atheist and I’m not an agnostic. I’m an acrostic. The whole thing puzzles me."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "0de62d0b-2bb1-3495-82b3-5520438803f3",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b2ec1b-9edc-3238-91a7-13b130556ef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To think long and carefully in bewilderment."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "intransitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3d26aafd-4edb-4fc6-b099-430836360af7",
                                                "sense_id": "0de62d0b-2bb1-3495-82b3-5520438803f3",
                                                "text": "We puzzled over the curious-shaped lock, but were unable to discover how the key should be inserted."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "10b177d1-d2e4-38d7-a608-2bbd0e5d2106",
                                        "entry_id": "d9b2ec1b-9edc-3238-91a7-13b130556ef9",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To make intricate or difficult to resolve; to entangle."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "transitive"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7bc002a4-01ad-4d3a-8d69-79146253b32f",
                                                "sense_id": "10b177d1-d2e4-38d7-a608-2bbd0e5d2106",
                                                "text": "The Ways of Heav’n are dark and intricate, / Puzzled in Mazes, and perplext with Errors; / Our Underſtanding traces ’em in vain, / Loſt and bewilder’d in the fruitleſs Search; […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3438284b-7149-4941-9c3f-2c070c33cf97",
                                                "sense_id": "10b177d1-d2e4-38d7-a608-2bbd0e5d2106",
                                                "text": "They disentangle from the puzzled skein."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
